1
00:00:57,560 --> 00:00:58,230
My Lord,

2
00:00:58,230 --> 00:01:00,230
you're finally back.

3
00:01:03,760 --> 00:01:04,760
What's the panic?

4
00:01:06,200 --> 00:01:07,460
The sky isn't falling.

5
00:01:09,600 --> 00:01:11,660
Zhaohan is only capable of this much,

6
00:01:11,700 --> 00:01:14,130
sneaking in when I'm not around.

7
00:01:15,230 --> 00:01:17,730
He's lost all the Heavenly Realm's face to the mortal world.

8
00:01:17,730 --> 00:01:18,100
My Lord,

9
00:01:18,100 --> 00:01:20,100
your spiritual power hasn't recovered yet.

10
00:01:20,100 --> 00:01:20,960
Now you've rushed back overnight

11
00:01:20,960 --> 00:01:21,700
and still have to fight the heavenly soldiers.

12
00:01:21,700 --> 00:01:22,460
Don't worry.

13
00:01:22,560 --> 00:01:24,160
To deal with these nobodies,

14
00:01:24,200 --> 00:01:26,800
half of my spiritual power is more than enough.

15
00:01:39,960 --> 00:01:40,759
Cangyuan,

16
00:01:41,229 --> 00:01:42,759
you actually dared to come.

17
00:01:43,360 --> 00:01:46,490
I thought you were going to hide for the rest of your life.

18
00:01:48,360 --> 00:01:49,360
Be smart.

19
00:01:50,130 --> 00:01:51,800
Hand over Baili,

20
00:01:52,630 --> 00:01:54,560
and I can spare your Demon Realm.

21
00:01:57,960 --> 00:01:58,759
Humph.

22
00:01:59,430 --> 00:02:00,260
Ah!

23
00:02:04,700 --> 00:02:05,530
Zhaohan,

24
00:02:06,060 --> 00:02:07,600
you control everything,

25
00:02:07,800 --> 00:02:10,259
and now you even want to control my marriage?

26
00:02:13,130 --> 00:02:16,130
For what you did back then, betraying her and extracting her divine bone,

27
00:02:16,130 --> 00:02:18,360
I haven't settled the score with you yet.

28
00:02:18,360 --> 00:02:20,890
And now you deliver yourself to my door to die.

29
00:02:21,360 --> 00:02:23,100
You asked for it.

30
00:02:23,700 --> 00:02:24,600
Take him down!

31
00:02:25,460 --> 00:02:27,230
I thought the Demon Lord was so powerful.

32
00:02:27,230 --> 00:02:28,430
Turns out your spiritual power is already exhausted.

33
00:02:28,430 --> 00:02:29,560
You're just an empty shell.

34
00:02:29,560 --> 00:02:30,730
Am I?

35
00:02:30,730 --> 00:02:32,390
Why don't you try and find out?

36
00:02:35,460 --> 00:02:36,530
Arrogant!

37
00:02:43,060 --> 00:02:44,230
Who else?

38
00:02:44,230 --> 00:02:45,400
Come at me together.

39
00:02:46,300 --> 00:02:48,030
Save me the trouble.

40
00:02:48,600 --> 00:02:52,000
I still have to go back and have dinner with my wife after this.

41
00:02:53,700 --> 00:02:55,430
Is it fun to hold on desperately?

42
00:02:55,430 --> 00:02:56,200
Cangyuan,

43
00:02:56,860 --> 00:02:59,060
you have less than a tenth of your spiritual power left,

44
00:02:59,060 --> 00:03:02,720
and you still want to stop my hundred thousand heavenly soldiers?

45
00:03:13,200 --> 00:03:15,060
Is this all the strength you have?

46
00:03:15,860 --> 00:03:16,630
Zhaohan,

47
00:03:17,230 --> 00:03:20,290
I see you're no different from three hundred years ago.

48
00:03:20,300 --> 00:03:21,800
Still the same trash.

49
00:03:22,900 --> 00:03:24,300
Still talking tough.

50
00:03:24,900 --> 00:03:26,300
I want to see

51
00:03:26,300 --> 00:03:28,360
how long you can protect Baili.

52
00:03:38,900 --> 00:03:40,700
You can protect her for a moment,

53
00:03:41,700 --> 00:03:42,960
but not for a lifetime.

54
00:03:43,860 --> 00:03:46,660
I extracted Baili's divine bone with my own hands.

55
00:03:46,760 --> 00:03:47,700
Her life,

56
00:03:48,560 --> 00:03:49,700
her past,

57
00:03:50,060 --> 00:03:51,900
are all in my grasp.

58
00:03:56,400 --> 00:03:59,930
Baili, did you think you could rest easy by relying on the Demon Realm?

59
00:03:59,930 --> 00:04:03,700
Your ancient divine veins can only be used by me.

60
00:04:04,230 --> 00:04:05,130
Take him back to the Heavenly Realm.

61
00:04:05,130 --> 00:04:06,030
Lock him in the Heavenly Prison.

62
00:04:06,030 --> 00:04:06,900
Watch him closely.

63
00:04:06,900 --> 00:04:07,800
Don't let him die.

64
00:04:07,800 --> 00:04:08,860
He's still useful.

65
00:04:12,400 --> 00:04:12,760
Commander,

66
00:04:12,760 --> 00:04:13,400
what do we do?

67
00:04:13,400 --> 00:04:15,400
We have to find a way to save the Lord.

68
00:04:16,529 --> 00:04:17,959
In the Three Realms,

69
00:04:18,560 --> 00:04:20,760
who else can stand against the Heavenly Emperor?

70
00:04:20,760 --> 00:04:22,300
Find Miss Baili.

71
00:04:22,430 --> 00:04:23,800
Maybe only she

72
00:04:23,800 --> 00:04:25,360
can save the Lord.

73
00:04:37,630 --> 00:04:38,230
Liar.

74
00:04:38,230 --> 00:04:39,100
Big liar.

75
00:04:39,300 --> 00:04:40,860
We agreed to have dinner together for my birthday,

76
00:04:40,860 --> 00:04:42,200
but you jumped out the window and ran away.

77
00:04:42,200 --> 00:04:43,460
You didn't even leave a note.

78
00:04:43,460 --> 00:04:44,530
It's all wasted.

79
00:04:44,600 --> 00:04:47,200
Feeding it to the dogs would be better than giving it to you.

80
00:04:47,200 --> 00:04:49,260
I even spent four hours stewing braised pork

81
00:04:49,260 --> 00:04:51,530
and half the night picking fabric for a new robe.

82
00:04:51,530 --> 00:04:52,700
It was all for nothing.

83
00:04:52,700 --> 00:04:53,560
When he gets back,

84
00:04:53,560 --> 00:04:54,730
the first punishment is kneeling on a washboard.

85
00:04:54,730 --> 00:04:55,930
He won't be allowed to get up until dawn.

86
00:04:55,930 --> 00:04:57,360
The second punishment is eating burnt porridge for a month,

87
00:04:57,360 --> 00:04:58,460
without even any pickles.

88
00:04:58,460 --> 00:04:59,360
The third punishment...

89
00:04:59,360 --> 00:05:02,230
is making him fill all the water vats in the yard.

90
00:05:04,360 --> 00:05:05,130
Hmph.

91
00:05:05,700 --> 00:05:08,230
But he seemed to be in a real hurry when he left.

92
00:05:08,260 --> 00:05:10,260
There were bloodstains on the windowsill.

93
00:05:10,260 --> 00:05:12,260
Did something really happen to him?

94
00:05:12,930 --> 00:05:14,530
No, I can't be soft-hearted.

95
00:05:14,630 --> 00:05:15,630
He loves to fool people so much,

96
00:05:15,630 --> 00:05:17,430
who knows where he went to show off and play the hero.

97
00:05:17,430 --> 00:05:18,800
When he comes back, I must interrogate him thoroughly.

98
00:05:18,800 --> 00:05:20,730
He can only eat after he confesses.

99
00:05:21,360 --> 00:05:22,130
Ah!

100
00:05:25,400 --> 00:05:26,200
Who is it?

101
00:05:26,200 --> 00:05:27,400
Banging on the door in broad daylight.

102
00:05:27,400 --> 00:05:28,200
Are you crazy?

103
00:05:47,700 --> 00:05:49,300
Miss Baili.
